IGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경과조치</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">법률 시행전 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등록예치금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">입학금 및 수업료</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">으로 납부한 등록금은 법률에 따라&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">입학금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수업료</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FO